  "plan": "Run a comprehensive Python script to: (1) search saved fpbase JSON for em_max=610 proteins cross-referenced to our PDB IDs; (2) retrieve BLAST results for the antibody variable region RIDs; (3) compare fpbase vs PDB sequences for Clover and mCherry to understand X residues; (4) extract and print all candidate protein sequences needed for the fusion.",
